@startuml activity-booking
title PetStay - Booking Process (UC-05)

skinparam defaultFontName "Tahoma"
skinparam shadowing false

' A single booking attempt. On errors, the customer can edit and start again.
' Lifecycle operations after creation are covered by state-booking.puml.

|Customer|
start
:Log in with an active account;
:Choose a room and stay dates;

|PetStay System|
:GET /bookings/new\nLoad booking form and available choices;

|Customer|
:Select pets; optionally select\nservices per pet and a promotion;
note right
  roomId, petIds,
  checkInDate, checkOutDate,
  servicePetIds, promotionId
end note

|PetStay System|
:GET /api/bookings/pet-availability\nDisable pets already reserved for those dates;
:Check form fields, date order, pet count\nand service recipients;
if (Form inputs valid?) then (yes)
  :POST /api/bookings/preview-price\npreviewPrice(request);
  note right
    prepareBooking(request, false)
    validates selections and calculates a quote.
    No save, locks or final availability checks.
  end note
else (no)
  :Show form validation message;
  |Customer|
  :Edit selections before retrying;
  stop
endif

|PetStay System|
if (Successful quote matches current inputs?) then (yes)
  :Display price breakdown;
else (no)
  :Show preview error / wait / retry message;\nprevent submission;
  |Customer|
  :Edit selections or retry price calculation;
  stop
endif

|Customer|
:Review booking and press Book;
:Confirm the booking dialog;

|PetStay System|
:POST /bookings\nResolve current user from Principal;
:form.setUserId(user.getId())\nvalidateForm(form, bindingResult);
if (bindingResult.hasErrors()?) then (yes)
  :loadChoices(...)\nReturn booking view with validation errors;
  |Customer|
  :Edit form before retrying;
  stop
else (no)
endif

|PetStay System|
:createBooking(form)\nBegin booking transaction;
:Validate required IDs, unique petIds\nand checkOutDate > checkInDate;
:Load User; lock Room and require ACTIVE;\nlock selected pets; check existence,\nactive flag, ownership and room capacity;
:Check pet overlaps, then room availability\nfor checkInDate and checkOutDate;
note right
  Checks run in this order and stop at the first error.
  PENDING, CONFIRMED and CHECKED_IN reserve space.
  An overlapping room booking blocks the whole room.
end note

if (Any request / resource / availability error?) then (yes)
  :Abort transaction; catch exception;\nreturn booking form with error details;
  |Customer|
  :Change pets, room or dates and retry;
  stop
else (no)
endif

|PetStay System|
:Build Booking with status = PENDING;\nadd BookingPet for each selected pet;
:Validate services and recipients;\nadd BookingExtraService per recipient\nwith quantity = 1 and price snapshot;
:If promotionId is supplied, load promotion\nand validate active flag and date range\nagainst today in Asia/Bangkok;

if (Any service / promotion error?) then (yes)
  :Abort transaction; catch exception;\nreturn booking form with error details;
  |Customer|
  :Change service / promotion selections and retry;
  stop
else (no)
endif

|PetStay System|
:Recalculate price with PricingContext;\nsnapshot all amounts and promotionName;
:bookingRepository.save(prepared.booking())\nCascade BookingPet and BookingExtraService;\npaymentStatus = UNPAID; set createdAt;
:Map to BookingResponse; commit transaction;\nredirect:/bookings/{created.id};

|Customer|
:View booking details\nstatus = PENDING, paymentStatus = UNPAID;
stop

@enduml
